  "abstract": "Production-grade writing and revision system for drafting, rewriting, line editing, review, humanisation, and adaptation. It protects factual and literal fidelity, applies genre-aware staged revision, uses publication-informed original examples to improve natural structure and long-prose digestibility, restores individual voice without fabricated personality, includes relation-first punctuation and sentence-flow transformations, and provides a calibrated catalogue of AI-like writing signals that never claims to determine authorship.",
